  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4260</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C7001</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>過去のワンダリデルって
まるでおとぎ話にでてくる
夢の街そのものだねぇ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The Wonderidell of the past is like this
dreamy world you'd find in a fairy tale.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4428</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C7002</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>こんなすごい街を
つくりあげた人に
会ってみたいなぁ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wish I got to meet the people
who built such an amazing city.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4780</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C7003</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ワンダリデルの設計・建設に
人間は関わっていない。
すべて機械による自動実行だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>No people were involved in the
design or construction of Wonderidell.
It is completely machine automated.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5000</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C7004</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そ、そうなんだ……
じゃあ、この街に美術館とか
芸術サロンはないの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>F-For real? So you don't have any
museums, art galleries or anything?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5416</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C7005</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>存在しない。結晶界の芸術は
より単純で直接的な娯楽に取って
代わられ、衰退してしまった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Negative. Quartzian art had fallen
into decline, instead replaced by simpler,
more involved forms of entertainment.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5876</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C7006</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>その結果、みんな『白化』して
彫刻や絵画みたいになっちゃった
なんて、皮肉すぎだよね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And in the end, everyone calcified into
sculptures against a painterly landscape.
Kinda ironic when you think about it...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
